{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CfUSux22TqjQRFTVdBYq3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the second shift now, don't buy the roaster yet. The month-to-month status of your two biggest wholesale accounts means the demand backing that 20% growth isn't locked in — $103K committed to a bigger machine is a bet on revenue that could walk with 30 days' notice, whereas the shift costs $50K/year, is reversible, and lets you capture the extra volume while you work on converting those accounts to contracts.\n\nThe real tradeoff: the shift accelerates wear on a machine you're now running twice as hard, so factor in earlier maintenance/replacement costs against the $4,200/month — if that math gets ugly or the growth proves durable once you've got firmer commitments, revisit the 35kg purchase then rather than now."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":40635,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8add49d5-06c3-417b-b8ab-0541c082405a","uuid":"3b9ecb9a-87f7-466c-8bfb-f8fe47245a5e","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:51:32.923Z","request_id":"req_011CfUSuwbjXd3t34wcZ1uPg"}
